This repository contains an independently written vLLM integration.

Algorithm and API references:

- RWKV-7 public recurrence specification:
  https://github.com/BlinkDL/RWKV-LM/blob/main/RWKV-v7/rwkv_v7_numpy.py
- vLLM public out-of-tree plugin interface:
  https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/design/plugin_system.html
- Optional FLA RWKV-7 operator API:
  https://github.com/fla-org/flash-linear-attention/tree/main/fla/ops/rwkv7

No source files from earlier third-party vLLM RWKV-7 pull requests are included.
